SUMMARY:Flamingo House Comedy Night
DESCRIPTION:Flamingo House Comedy Night\nGet ready for a fun night out at the Flamingo House! Join us on June 10\, 2026 at 7:00 PM (Pacific Time) for some laughs and good vibes. Whether you’re coming with friends or flying solo\, this comedy night promises a great time with hilarious acts. Don’t miss your chance to unwind and enjoy some top-notch humor in a chill\, in-person setting. See you there! \n2nd Wednesdays of the Month \n$15 Online $20 at door \nComedians from Netflix\, Prime\, BET and more \nJahlikefunny.eventbrite.com \nThis month we are partnering with a non profit \nhttp://stablhousing.org \nSTABL Housing is a non-profit 501(c)(3) organization. \nEIN 33-4955473
