SUMMARY:Teen Girls Summer Strength Training
DESCRIPTION:Want to get stronger\, faster\, and more confident this summer? \nJoin our 8-Week Teen Girls Strength Training Program (Ages 13–17) \n📅 June 30 – August 20\n📅 Tuesdays & Thursdays at 10:30 AM \n⭐ Pick Any 6 Weeks for $300\n⭐ Train All 8 Weeks for Just $350 \n✔ Build muscle and confidence\n✔ Learn proper lifting techniques\n✔ Reduce injury risk\n✔ Improve athletic performance\n✔ Train in a fun\, supportive environment \nWhether you’re preparing for your next sports season or simply want to feel stronger\, this program will help you stand out from the crowd! \n🔥 Stronger. Faster. More Confident. \n⚠️ Space is limited and spots will fill quickly. \n📧 Reserve your spot today: thrivechooseyou@gmail.com
URL:https://thedirt.online/event/teen-girls-summer-strength-training/2026-07-09/
